regel-screensaver (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.3.0: Neural Audio Choreography & 8 Aesthetic Archetypes.
  * Concept 8: The Analog Telemetry Console with ANSI C16.5 ballistic
    galvanometers, P1 phosphor CRT oscilloscope, Nixie tube BPM readouts,
    and external faceted jewel pilot lamps.
  * Deep neural audio rhythm and singing voice integration:
    real-time beat phase, transient detection, vocal presence, and harmonic
    choreography wired across all 8 visual archetypes.
  * 8-tile showcase matrix and headless GPU RHI capture tools.
  * Zero-warning Lintian conformance across binary and source packages.

