regel-screensaver (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.2.0: Native KDE Plasma 6 Desktop & Panel Audio Visualizer.
  * New Plasmoid 'org.regel.widget' compliant with Plasma/Applet standard.
  * Resizable planar desktop containment and compact animated panel equalizer.
  * Interactive on-hover HUD with archetype cycling and live audio telemetry.
  * Dedicated KCM.SimpleKCM widget configuration dialog (ConfigGeneral.qml).
  * High-resolution showcase banners, widget previews, and animated GIFs.

